                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2873120,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "A city needs to have a sense of activity, so it needs to be lively, with sounds like the clack of high heels on a pavement or the hiss of a coffee machine.",
